The recommended way to create an array is with an array literal:

### Code Snippets

```
new Array()
new Array(number)
new Array(element1, element2, ..., elementN)
Array()
Array(number)
Array(element1, element2, ..., elementN)

---

new Array()
new Array(3)
new Array("3")
new Array("Saab", "Volvo", "BMW")

---

Array()
Array(3)
Array("3")
